WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.037
Eco Town needs power. Clean power.

2
00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:07.220
<v Posy>Posy: Florence, make enough clean power for every home.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:11.175
<v Florence>Florence: Solar panels on every roof! On a normal day, that is plenty.

4
00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:14.476
<v Florence>Florence: I am 90% sure. That is very, very sure!

5
00:00:14.546 --> 00:00:17.192
<v Dev>Dev: What about a day that is not normal?

6
00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:20.622
Ninety per cent sure. Is that the same as right?

7
00:00:20.692 --> 00:00:22.397
Which day would you test?
